{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object approached, grab it and check its properties. If visible, approach it. Move randomly and do specific task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToRandomLocation    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />\"",
